{'symbol': 'JBHT', 'date': '2022-08-11 16:15:00', 'title': 'J.B. HUNT, UNIVERSITY OF ARKANSAS COLLABORATION FOCUSES ON FUTURE OF SUPPLY CHAIN', 'text': "LOWELL, ARK.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--J.B. HUNT TRANSPORT SERVICES INC., ONE OF THE LARGEST SUPPLY CHAIN SOLUTIONS PROVIDERS IN NORTH AMERICA, AND THE UNIVERSITY OF ARKANSAS ANNOUNCED THE SAM M. WALTON COLLEGE OF BUSINESS PROGRAM FOR STUDYING SUPPLY CHAIN, RANKED NUMBER ONE BY GARTNER, HAS OFFICIALLY BEEN RENAMED THE J.B. HUNT TRANSPORT DEPARTMENT OF SUPPLY CHAIN MANAGEMENT. LEADERSHIP FROM BOTH ORGANIZATIONS WERE AT J.B. HUNT'S CORPORATE CAMPUS TODAY TO DISCUSS HOW THEIR EFFORTS ARE MAKING NORTHWEST"}